    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 73 (Monday, April 29, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. LAWLER:\nH.R. 8152.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle 1, Section 8, Clause 18 of the U.S. Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo amend the Export Control Reform Act of 2018 to provide\nfor control of remote access of items, and for other\npurposes.\n[Page H2701]\n</pre>",
